          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ghana iideepa gwanda saseeda dearjooda beasta badayda mughoowooda ak gwardu biyeeyda heeda ak beasta ak ghoah hiidoonda, nea areara dea eeshmeeda ghanea eesh, ",
          "type": "text",
