          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama sikteawa ashoohoocheanda, ama niyamwa buudeega heeda mida dearjooda ak ea mii eashish ak ea mii ghaghurghura ea ghang'al mughoowooda saseeda, nea gapseada, abeeda gayghwasach ashoohoocheanda eawooji ispwa, ",
