        {
          "text": "ak gaygwasikteawa ashoohoocheanda eaweeteaba ispwa; ama deepa ea nighayda aba mughoowooda, abeeda gaygwargu ashoohoocheanda gideaba gaba ririnnyaan; nih geeyooda udamusuura. ",
