          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gaygwasikteawa ashoohoocheanda geeyooda; ama ahiimu gideaba ghaghurghura ea ea mawuurji sea mughoowooda, nea buudeega mida ea niwaar booreega nea manang'i, abeeda gaygwargu ashoohoocheanda gideaba gaba ririnnyaan; nih nyawiisheanda, was udamusuureeda uhuuda ghana ea ganyamooda. ",
          "type": "text",
