              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama sikteawa ashoohoocheanda nyawiisheanda was geeyooda, ak ghoahiimu gideaba mii ghaghurghura ea ghang'al mughoowooda ak ea manda jeeda buudeanda duw, abeeda gayghwasach ashoohoocheanda siida mideawa geeyooda nyawiishta eawooji ispwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
