              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eaweeteaba ispwa gaygwasikteawa ashoohoocheanda geeyooda; ama mii ghaghayda nyawiishta, nea manda jeeda buudeanda oar booreega, nea nyawiisheanda ghoahiimu gideaba mwaghurghura ea ghang'al mughoowooda, ",
          "type": "text",
