          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gayghwareakghu uhuudaanyi, nea nyawiisheanda ea mayghwareakghu; ak abeeda gayghwasach ashoohoocheanda siida bearji nyawiishta eawooji ispwa suuk; ",
          "type": "text",
