              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ama ng'ata eawooji ispwa gaygwasikteawa ashoohoocheanda nyawiisheanda, ama mii ghaghayda aba badayda mughoowooda nea ghoahiimu gideaba mwaghurghura ea ghang'al mughoowooda, abeeda gaygwargu ashoohoocheanda gideaba siida maba ririnnyaan; abeeda gaygoohuun hang'weakaaschi, ak gayghamiidu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
