          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaygwasikteawa ashoohoocheanda, ama nighayda nyawiishta aba badayda mughoowooda, abeeda ea maygagasa ashoohoocheanda buudeega oar booreega; aba gideaba gaba ririnnyaan. ",
          "type": "text",
