              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iidaah niny nyawiisheanda, ak ea nirina jeeda buudeega duwas, gayghahaap nyawiishta, abeeda niimmiidu; abeeda gaygwargu ashoohoocheanda gideaba niny maba ririnnyaan.",
