          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gaygwasikteawa ashoohoocheanda, ama deepa ghwadaah hiidoonyeeka mida badayda mughoowooda saseeda ea mii gaweeriidi muuchi, abeeda ea weeshinda ridu aba badayda mughoowooda gil; maba ririnnyaan.",
