          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gaygwasikteawa ashoohoocheanda, ama deepa heeda apka ea areara nea gwanda eeshmeeda aba uhuudaanyi mida mearumeeda ghana ea gheamamdaanyi meara, uurji sea gwadeagooda udamusuura aba badayda mughoowooda saseeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
