              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata gaygwasikteawa geeyooda eaweeteaba ispwa. Ama nighayda geeyooda aba badayda hang'da, ghana ea weasta ghana ea gulbeenga, ghana ea badayda eaghwada, ghana ea gida wassean sisna muunda, abeeda geeyooda udamusuureeda muy; nih gaba ririnnyaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
