              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gayghaghwarda hang'da, ada ea weasta mideawa geeyooda gil ghana ea gulbeenga, ghana ea hang'da buudeega ghana ea hang'da bumbuni, ghana ea gida wassean bea muunda, aba gideaba nih udamusureeda muy; gajeaghwarda aba jeeda beasta.",
